	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Migrated from modules/footprints.pretty/RJE72-188-1401 (pads unchanged, used on Blixten Gateway); outline, courtyard and fab rebuilt to KLC in 2026-10. Amphenol RJE72-188-1401 RJ45 jack; vendor STEP (M-RJE72-188-1X01-REVT1). The jack sinks 3.5 mm through the board: it needs the PCB notch drawn on Dwgs.User, per Amphenol P-RJE72-188-1X0X rev D recommended PCB layout (16.20 wide, R0.50 corners, from 1.20 in front of the pin-1 row to the board edge 7.68 in front of the shield tabs); the same notch as on the Blixten Gateway board. Amphenol specifies -1X01 for a 2.36 mm PCB (-1X02/-1X03 for 1.57)")
	(tags "RJ45 Ethernet jack Amphenol RJE72")
